OL,3,GNEWSABronze Susie cat statue emerges
OL,4,Afrom foundry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statue of a town's famous cat has
OL,7,Fbeen cast in bronze, with the sculptor
OL,8,Fsharing the first images of the
OL,9,Fwork-in-progress from the foundry.
OL,11,FAma Menec has been commissioned to
OL,12,Fcreate a statue of Susie, whose
OL,13,Fadventures in Dorchester, Dorset, are
OL,14,Ffollowed by more than 13,000 people on
OL,15,FFacebook.
OL,17,FThe Weymouth-based artist said she was
OL,18,F"really pleased with the quality of the
OL,19,Fcasting" by Pangolin Editions in
OL,20,FGloucestershire.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
